{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"z30_9xd_pyz","canonical_person_id":"z30_9xd_pyz","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["z30_9xd_pyz"],"persons":[{"id":"z30_9xd_pyz","label":"魏顆","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"魏顆","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008:m0176"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008:m0176","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu","quote":"魏顆"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"魏顆，見本組原文及身份互校。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-070-bianhu-ws2595540","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-070","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008:m0176"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008:m0176","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008:m0176"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-070-bianhu-ws2595540"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008:m0176","surface":"魏顆","start":176,"end":178,"person_id":"z30_9xd_pyz","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-070-bianhu:p008","text":"時淮南小中正王式繼母，前夫終，更適式父。式父終，喪服訖，議還前夫家。前夫家亦有繼子，奉養至終，遂合葬於前夫。式自云：「父臨終，母求去，父許諾。」於是制出母齊衰期。壼奏曰：「就如式父臨終許諾，必也正名，依禮爲無所據。若夫有命，須顯七出之責，當存時棄之，無緣以絕義之妻留家制服。若式父臨困謬亂，使去留自由者，此必爲相要以非禮，則存亡無所得從，式宜正之以禮。魏顆父命不從其亂，陳乾昔欲以二婢子殉，其子以非禮不從，春秋、禮記善之。並以妾媵，猶正以禮，況其母乎！式母於夫，生事奉終，非爲既絕之妻。夫亡制服，不爲無義之婦。自云守節，非爲更嫁。離絕之斷，在夫沒之後。夫之既沒，是其從子之日，而式以爲出母，此母以子出也。致使存無所容居，沒無所託也。寄命於他人之門，埋尸於無名之冢。若式父亡後，母尋沒於式家，必不以爲出母明矣。許諾之命一耳，以爲母于同居之時，至沒前子之門而不以爲母，此爲制離絕於二居，裁出否於意斷。離絕之斷，非式而誰！假使二門之子皆此母之生，母戀前子，求去求絕，非禮於後家，還反又非禮於前門，去不可去，還不可還，則爲無寄之人也。式必內盡匡諫，外極防閑，不絕明矣。何至守不移於至親，略情禮於假繼乎！繼母如母，聖人之教。式爲國士，閨門之內犯禮違義，開闢未有，於父則無追亡之善，於母則無孝敬之道，存則去留自由，亡則合葬路人，可謂生事不以禮，死葬不以禮者也。虧損世教，不可以居人倫詮正之任。案侍中、司徒、臨潁公組敷宣五教，實在任人，而含容違禮，曾不貶黜；揚州大中正、侍中、平望亭侯曄，淮南大中正、散騎侍郎弘，顯執邦論，朝野取信，曾不能率禮正違，崇孝敬之教，並爲不勝其任。請以見事免組、曄、弘官，大鴻臚削爵土，廷尉結罪。」疏奏，詔特原組等，式付鄉邑清議，廢棄終身。壼遷吏部尚書。王含之難，加中軍將軍。含滅，以功封建興縣公，尋遷領軍將軍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":74,"last_line":74,"raw_start":6556,"raw_end":7401,"raw_character_offsets":[6563,6564,6565,6566,6567,6568,6569,6570,6571,6572,6573,6574,6575,6576,6577,6578,6579,6580,6581,6582,6583,6584,6585,6586,6587,6588,6589,6590,6591,6592,6593,6594,6595,6596,6597,6598,6599,6600,6601,6602,6603,6604,6605,6606,6607,6608,6609,6610,6611,6612,6613,6614,6615,6616,6617,6618,6619,6620,6621,6622,6623,6624,6625,6626,6627,6628,6629,6630,6631,6632,6633,6634,6635,6636,6637,6638,6639,6640,6641,6642,6643,6644,6645,6646,6647,6648,6656,6657,6658,6659,6660,6661,6662,6663,6664,6665,6666,6667,6668,6669,6670,6671,6672,6673,6674,6675,6676,6677,6678,66